    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>.",
