    {
      "source": "Returns the required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> or throws <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> if there is no evaluation\ncontext available.",
      "translation": "返回所需的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>，或者在无法提供评估上下文时抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Expressions are executed using an evaluation context. This context is used to resolve references during (SpEL,\nproperty placeholder) expression evaluation.",
      "translation": "表达式使用评估上下文执行。该上下文用于在（SpEL、属性占位符）表达式评估期间解析引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a href=\"ValueEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueEvaluationContext</code></a> for the given environment and evaluation context.",
      "translation": "为给定环境和评估上下文创建一个新的<a href=\"ValueEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.expression 中的接口\"><code>ValueEvaluationContext</code></a>。",
